          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "These are ‘equivalent fractions’ that denote the same length, but they are expressed in terms of different fractional units."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.547,
            0.884,
            0.593
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, check whether "
